  "instance_name": "Michael_J_Fox",
  "label": "Actor Michael J. Fox",
  "description": "Michael J. Fox is a well-known Canadian-American actor, recognized for his roles in popular films and TV shows, including 'Back to the Future' and 'Family Ties'. His public image is often associated with charm, intelligence, and a certain level of sophistication, especially when seen in formal attire. The meme leverages his recognizable persona to create irony — juxtaposing his polished, high-status appearance with the mundane or disappointing product (shakes) he is humorously implied to be associated with. This contrast is central to the meme’s humor and requires knowledge of his public identity and career to be fully understood.",
